<title>UK: Altram preferred bidder for Manchester metro.</title>
<headline>Altram preferred bidder for Manchester metro.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Serco Group said on Friday that the Altram consortium, of which it is part, was awarded the preferred bidder status to build and operate the Manchester Metrolink extension.  </p>
<p>The Altram consortium, which expects passenger revenues of over 400 million stg, is an equal partnership betwen Seco and Laing Civil Engineering and Ansaldo Trasporti Spa.</p>
<p>The Manchester contract is to build and operate the 100 million stg Metrolink expansion and covers a 17 year period.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
